  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe merge-ready skill collects all pages of reviews, comments and label events.\nIt requires evidence of an independent review before it offers a PR.\nIt preserves documented reviews by independent agents that share the author's account.\nIt passes only the retained PR numbers to the merge planner.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe skill checked collaborator status without an explicit refusal for author-only review evidence.\nPlanning by label could also include PRs excluded during collection.\n\n## Tests\n\nThese three pins failed before the fix and passed after it:\n\n- `merge_ready_collects_paginated_review_evidence`\n- `merge_ready_refuses_author_only_evidence_without_independent_agent_provenance`\n- `merge_ready_plans_only_the_filtered_pr_numbers`\n\nEach pin failed individually when the upstream skill replaced the fixed skill.\nEach pin passed individually after the fixed skill was restored.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed.\nIt ran 137 unit tests, the three new pins and the existing artifact pin.\n`cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\nThe branch starts from upstream/main at `ae601e47`.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe tests inspect the skill instructions.\nThey do not exercise live GitHub review classification or an agent executing the workflow.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: medium\nChangelog: Require counted independent review evidence before merge-ready offers a PR.\nFixes #1828\n",
